# Change Requests Directory

This directory stores formal change requests for the framework.

## Purpose

Track and manage proposed changes to the Solo Agent Development Framework through a structured change request process.

## Process

1. Create a new change request file: `cr-{number}-{description}.md`
2. Follow the change request template
3. Submit for review via the governance process
4. Track status and resolution

## Templates

- [Change Request Template](../../04-templates/change-request-template.md)

## Current Change Requests

None at this time.
